# FMO Reservation System — Error Troubleshooting Guide

## 1. 502 Bad Gateway

**Error:**
```text
502 Bad Gateway
```

**Cause:** React/Vite cannot communicate with the PHP backend on port 8000. The PHP server may have stopped or may not be reachable.

**Solution:**

Start PHP from the `capstone` root directory.

Windows (PowerShell):
```powershell
C:\xampp\php\php.exe -S 127.0.0.1:8000 -t .\admin\api
```

MacBook:
```bash
/Applications/XAMPP/xamppfiles/bin/php -S 127.0.0.1:8000 -t ./admin/api
```

Keep the terminal running.

To test whether PHP is reachable:

Windows:
```powershell
curl.exe -i http://127.0.0.1:8000/me-requester.php
```

MacBook:
```bash
curl -i http://127.0.0.1:8000/me-requester.php
```

An HTTP response, even `401 Unauthorized`, means PHP is reachable.

If PHP is reachable but Vite still returns 502, check `vite.config.js` and restart Vite.

